    {
      "block_id": "2605.24856_p31_b15",
      "text": "\u2022 Figure 1 (right panel): v1 showed credibility in Qwen2.5-0.5B; v2 shows temporal_order\nin Pythia-1.4B. \u201cBlack hole\u201d terminology \u2192\u201cMajor.\u201d\n\u2022 Figure 2: v1 showed negation in OPT-2.7B (two \u201cblack-hole\u201d CAZes plus a velocity panel);\nv2 shows causation in OPT-2.7B (three scored CAZes, no velocity panel).\n",
      "bbox": [
        85.33,
        358.35,
        541.6,
        410.12
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        341,
        1433,
        2166,
